 "headline": "“THAT WAS SERIOUSLY ONE OF THE COOLEST EXPERIENCES WE'VE EVER HAD!” — Dylan Bradshaw, Creator",
 "intro": "A DAY OF COSMIC EXPLORATION AT THE PIXAR CAMPUS TO CELEBRATE ELIO!",
