   ],
   "html": "<p>To promote the upcoming release of Elio, we developed a creator content day of celestial creativity and expression for a handpicked group of global influencers.</p>\n<p>Guests were immersed into the world through a series of thoughtfully designed, intergalactic-themed activities and content opportunities - from cosmic light photography and slime experiences to friendship bracelet stations, stargazing, and immersive photo ops.</p>"
  }
