  {
   "title": "PROGRAMMING",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Pixar tapped us to build a full programming schedule around an exclusive inside look at the making of Elio on their campus. The day was packed with content-driven moments - including a cinematic recreation of Elio's \"Abduct Me!\" scene with laser-cut sand carvings and drone capture, and a dinner on the decorated terrace overlooking a soccer field where glowing green lights spelled out Elio.</p>",
     "right": "<p>As the sun set, guests shifted into an evening of intergalactic exploration designed to spark childlike wonder. Guests moved through an Elio-inspired environment featuring a guided fiber optic light photography session with LA-based artist Katrina Brown, intergalactic slime-making with the Sloomoo Institute, and DIY glow-in-the-dark friendship bracelets. We ended the night under the stars with a professional astronomer-led stargazing session.</p>"
    },
    {
