  {
   "title": "DECOR",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Environmental lighting played a key role in setting the tone, with star laser projections, glowing orbs, and washes of blue, purple, and amber transforming the space. As creators exited the campus, fog-lined LED arches, light portals and takeaway goodie bags created a magical farewell.</p>"
